# Cloudflare Pages SPA history fallback.
#
# Pages already falls back to index.html automatically when a project has no
# top-level 404.html — but that is implicit, and adding a 404.html later would
# silently start 404ing client-side routes like /adm. This makes it explicit.
#
# Vite copies public/ into dist/, which is where Pages expects _redirects.
/*    /index.html   200
